- **`LevelUp()` overflow:** if `currentExp = 100`, maxExp = 10 → `currentExp -= maxExp` (current = 90) still >= maxExp, but loop is single-pass → possible leveling undercount. Should `while` or recompute remainder.
- **`currentHealth = maxHealth` on level-up** = full heal on level-up (probably intended).
- **Late binding:** components read `StatsManager.Instance` at runtime frequently — a race if Awake hasn’t run (Awake runs before Start for the same scene, so generally OK).
